      "description": {
        "en": "Dual-mode tender and bid drafting engine. Registers 21 directly callable mont_* tools with code-enforced compliance rules (T-B1 to T-B5), a fact-source allowlist, three human gates backed by a tamper-evident audit chain, score-aligned outlining, dual-threshold similarity checks, and pure-JS .docx export. No network access, no subprocesses, no credentials, no install-time scripts.",
        "zh": "招投标双模辅助编制引擎。注册 21 个可直接调用的 mont_* 工具，含代码层强制的合规规则（T-B1~T-B5）、事实来源白名单、三道人工门禁与防篡改审计链、评分对齐目录、双阈值雷同自检、纯 JS .docx 导出。不联网、不启子进程、不读凭据、无安装期脚本。"
      },
